## Capability

Attach an ideal differential probe or a meter with declared loading. Trigger a bounded capture against simulation time and inspect values with cursors.

## Completion checks

- [ ] Measure a divider with both probe models, then trigger on the RC edge. Compare voltage, loading difference and elapsed time with reference values at two display rates.

